From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dariusz Majnert <dariusz.majnert@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:00:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] availability-mcodes

Ported to v2.10.0-pre2. M54 acquisition homing runs through the queued
G28.2 home cycle (see runtime-joint-and-spindle-availability), so
tests/availability-mcodes also covers Machine Off during acquisition
homing and a resumable Stop during M54 homing, which stays STOPPING until
homing ends as it does during G28.2.
